    "text": "13 hours ago MITCHELL — South Lawrence Utilities has issued an immediate boil order for a specific portion of its service area following a water main break on Wednesday morning. The boil order is in effect until further notice for all customers located from Thompson Lane east on State Road 60 West and Old Highway 60 West to State Road 37. Read full article",
